## Auto-Apply-Rules (`.claude/rules/`)

Werden automatisch bei Edits in matching Files angewendet:

| Rule | Trigger |
|------|---------|
| `general.md` | Alle Files |
| `python.md` | `*.py` |
| `discord-cog.md` | `cogs/*.py` |
| `fastapi-routes.md` | `web/routes/*.py`, `web/app.py` |
| `database.md` | `modules/database/*.py` |
| `server-edits.md` | systemd, nginx, server.properties |
| `secret-handling.md` | Global, .env-Pattern + Token-Vars |

