## Production-Guides (`docs/production/`)

Wiederverwendbare Setup-Guides:

- `secret-management.md` (10 min) — Token-Hygiene, .env-Patterns
- `security-headers.md` (5 min) — nginx HSTS/CSP/X-Frame-Options
